VISUAL: A screen displaying "FRAMEBOY ADVANCE" with a 360-degree view of a room, showing "Streaming" status and "MOVE" and "LOOK" joysticks.
AUDIO: 'users and I am so excited to hopefully be able to try Atlas soon. I have a library of unfortunately thousands of captures that did not come out very well and I\'m very very excited to hopefully revisit them and reprocess and see what'

